{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":15721,\"date\":\"2026-06-24T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-24T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-beta-2-disponibile-su-alcuni-apple-watch\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27 beta 2 disponibile su alcuni Apple Watch\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato watchOS 27 developer beta 2 su alcuni Apple Watch, completando la seconda ondata di beta estive dedicate agli sviluppatori.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/watchos-27--768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27-\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15684,\"date\":\"2026-06-22T14:28:13+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-22T12:28:13+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-roadmap-prossimi-18-mesi-20-prodotti-attesi\",\"title\":\"Apple, la roadmap dei prossimi 18 mesi è enorme: ecco i 20 prodotti attesi\",\"excerpt\":\"Una panoramica dei 20 prodotti attesi nei prossimi 18 mesi per Apple, tra aggiornamenti di piattaforme e nuove linee di prodotto.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Keynote_Steve-Jobs-Theater_09122018.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Keynote_Steve-Jobs-Theater_09122018\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15670,\"date\":\"2026-06-22T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-22T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-cinque-nuove-app-siri-ai-remote-find-my-watch-pass-designer\",\"title\":\"Apple presenta cinque nuove app: Siri AI, Remote, Find My su Watch e Pass Designer\",\"excerpt\":\"Da WWDC 2026 arrivano Siri AI con app dedicata, il ritorno di Apple TV Remote, la nuova app Find My su Apple Watch e Pass Designer per Wallet. In parallelo, Claris aggiorna FileMaker Go 2026.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Logo-Spotlight-Blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Spotlight-Blue\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15589,\"date\":\"2026-06-17T12:09:20+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-17T10:09:20+00:00\",\"slug\":\"visual-intelligence-ios-27-nuove-funzioni-accesso-rapido\",\"title\":\"Visual Intelligence in iOS 27: nuove funzioni e accesso più rapido\",\"excerpt\":\"In iOS 27 Visual Intelligence riceve un grande aggiornamento: arriva nella Camera tramite una nuova modalità Siri, introduce suggerimenti contestuali e si estende anche a iPad e Mac per usare le stesse capacità su più dispositivi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-27-visual-intelligence-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-visual-intelligence-feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15546,\"date\":\"2026-06-16T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-16T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-2-ios-26-6-e-versioni-per-ipados-macos-tvos-watchos-26\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 2 di iOS 26.6 e le versioni per iOS, iPadOS, macOS, tvOS e watchOS\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha reso disponibile la seconda beta di iOS 26.6, insieme alle beta 2 di iPadOS 26.6, macOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e watchOS 26.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-26.6-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15539,\"date\":\"2026-06-15T20:42:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-15T18:42:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-aggiorna-app-store-consigli-personalizzati-strumenti-marketing\",\"title\":\"Apple aggiorna l’App Store: consigli personalizzati e nuovi strumenti marketing\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuove “Personalized Collections” con “App Notes” per scoprire app e giochi su misura, insieme a Creative Assets e Asset Library per aiutare gli sviluppatori a promuovere i propri contenuti.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-App-Store-General-Feature-JoeBlue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-App-Store-General-Feature-JoeBlue\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15501,\"date\":\"2026-06-15T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-15T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"supporto-software-apple-interrompe-16-dispositivi-autunno\",\"title\":\"Supporto software in calo: Apple interrompe l’aggiornamento per 16 dispositivi\",\"excerpt\":\"In autunno Apple terminerà il supporto software per 16 dispositivi tra Apple Watch, iPad, Mac e Apple TV. I tagli più ampi riguardano Apple Watch, mentre macOS 27 sancisce la fine dei Mac Intel.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Logo-Top-Half-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Top-Half\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15420,\"date\":\"2026-06-13T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-11T22:04:27+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-modalita-recupero-stile-mac-iphone\",\"title\":\"iOS 27 porta sull’iPhone una modalità di recupero “stile Mac”\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27 e iPadOS 27 arriva una nuova modalità di recupero: avvio di un’interfaccia alternativa separata dal sistema, con ripristino, diagnostica e fix senza collegare il computer.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/ios-27-recovery-mode-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-27-recovery-mode\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15439,\"date\":\"2026-06-12T14:28:33+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-12T18:39:25+00:00\",\"slug\":\"whatsapp-non-funzionera-piu-su-alcuni-iphone-requisiti-ios-15-5\",\"title\":\"WhatsApp non funzionerà più su alcuni iPhone: requisiti iOS aggiornati\",\"excerpt\":\"Dal 30 novembre 2026 WhatsApp richiederà almeno iOS 15.5 su iPhone e iPadOS 15.5 su iPad. Chi non aggiorna potrebbe perdere l’accesso all’app.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Whatsapp-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Whatsapp-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15337,\"date\":\"2026-06-08T14:06:40+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T12:06:40+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ipados-27-quattro-novita-wwdc-safari-correttore-grammaticale\",\"title\":\"iPadOS 27: quattro novità in arrivo alla WWDC, da Safari al correttore grammaticale di sistema\",\"excerpt\":\"Alla WWDC si profila un iPadOS 27 con quattro novità: aggiornamenti per Safari, un correttore grammaticale di sistema e altre funzioni attese per migliorare produttività e scrittura.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/ipados-27--768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ipados-27-\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15275,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-pubblica-wallpaper-playlist-video-get-ready-per-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica wallpaper, playlist e video “Get Ready” per WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Prima dell’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple rende disponibili una nuova wallpaper per iPhone, iPad e Mac, una playlist su Apple Music e un video “Get Ready” per prepararsi all’evento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC-2026-Wallpaper-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC-2026-Wallpaper\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15273,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:39+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:39+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-manca-una-settimana-placeholder-youtube-keynote-diretta\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026, manca una settimana: placeholder YouTube e keynote in diretta\",\"excerpt\":\"A una settimana dall’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple ha attivato un placeholder su YouTube con promemoria per il keynote del 8 giugno. La diretta sarà disponibile anche su Apple Events e Apple TV.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15267,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:14:47+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:14:47+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-nuova-app-siri-dedicata\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: arriva la nuova app Siri dedicata\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27, iPadOS 27 e macOS 27 debutta per la prima volta un’app Siri standalone: uno spazio dedicato per conversare, cercare sul web e usare dati personali.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Finder-Siri-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Finder-Siri-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15259,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T14:30:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:39:02+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-macbook-ultra-iphone-pieghevole-novita-in-arrivo\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, MacBook Ultra e iPhone pieghevole: le novità in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi leak su Siri in iOS 27, rumor su un possibile “MacBook Ultra”, aggiornamenti su Apple Watch per il monitoraggio glicemico e prime indicazioni sull’iPhone pieghevole.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/top-stories-2026-05-30-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top-stories-2026-05-30\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15253,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini-quasi-pronti-siri-aggiornata-attesa\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini “quasi pronti”: Siri aggiornata attesa\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini sarebbero pronti da mesi, ma il lancio slitterebbe finché non arriva Siri più personalizzata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15230,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T17:30:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:24:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-pubbliche-ios-26-6-macos-tahoe-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Disponibili le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6, iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6 e tvOS 26.6. Arrivano due giorni dopo le beta per sviluppatori.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15154,\"date\":\"2026-05-27T18:30:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-27T16:30:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-ios-26-6-ipados-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta di iOS 26.6 e iPadOS 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito le prime beta di iOS 26.6 e iPadOS 26.6 agli sviluppatori. Il download avviene da Impostazioni > Generali > Aggiornamento software.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15123,\"date\":\"2026-05-24T15:13:28+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-24T13:13:28+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prepara-genai-apple-com-in-vista-del-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple prepara genai.apple.com in vista del WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Spunta il sottodominio genai.apple.com su DNS Apple, in anticipo sul WWDC 2026. Non risulta ancora collegato a una pagina attiva.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15100,\"date\":\"2026-05-23T16:30:50+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-23T16:00:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-siri-riprogettato-accessibilita-ios-27\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026: Siri riprogettato e nuove funzioni di accessibilità in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple conferma WWDC 2026 (8-12 giugno). Attese novità su iOS 27, con un Siri ripensato, funzioni di accessibilità e aggiornamenti per iOS 27 e altri sistemi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15039,\"date\":\"2026-05-21T09:44:21+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-21T06:47:14+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-didascalie-automatiche-video-personali-iphone\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: didascalie automatiche per i video personali su iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple anticipa nuove funzioni di accessibilità: iOS 27 può generare automaticamente didascalie per i video personali, con supporto iniziale in inglese.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Says-iOS-27-Can-Automatically-Add-Captions-to-Your-Personal-iPhone-Videos-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Says-iOS-27-Can-Automatically-Add-Captions-to-Your-Personal-iPhone-Videos-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15037,\"date\":\"2026-05-21T08:30:11+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-21T06:46:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-voice-control-linguaggio-naturale-upgrade-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: Voice Control con linguaggio naturale e upgrade Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple aggiorna Voice Control su iPhone e iPad con supporto al linguaggio naturale tramite Apple Intelligence. Funzione disponibile inizialmente in inglese in alcuni Paesi.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27s-New-AI-Voice-Control-Feature-Hints-at-Major-Siri-Upgrade-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27s-New-AI-Voice-Control-Feature-Hints-at-Major-Siri-Upgrade-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15019,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T18:30:19+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:59:44+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-nuove-funzioni-accessibilita-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"Apple anticipa nuove funzioni di accessibilità con Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple annuncia aggiornamenti accessibilità basati su Apple Intelligence per VoiceOver, Magnifier, Voice Control e Accessibility Reader, con sottotitoli generati e controllo carrozzina su Vision Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-Accessibility-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Accessibility-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14974,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T14:30:26+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:06:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-programma-wwdc-2026-inviti-media\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica il programma di WWDC 2026 e invia inviti ai media\",\"excerpt\":\"WWDC 2026 si terrà dal 8 al 12 giugno. La keynote inizierà